se evidence and must record the exact supplied suite digest without advancing a committed pin. The released-suite pin and no-skip CI audit is TASK-260720-1utsx8 after protocol release qualification.","scope":"Work from the landed dependency handoffs and the immutable curator-spec 1.0.0-rc.5 candidate conformance root supplied through CURATOR_CONFORMANCE_ROOT, whose manifest.json must hash to sha256:b6f56aacc0e37dcc6692f73f641bff761e89b645adfe20a47a06d81c6fda204c. This is a verification task, not a new design task. Run the repository-supported full test, strict typing, packaging metadata, cross-platform CI, and conformance commands from a clean task worktree. Native real-fixture go-v1 verification covers macOS and Windows; Linux stays explicitly deferred to TASK-260728-1skseh and TASK-260728-1e6811 and no Linux driver success may be claimed. Make only narrow integration corrections; route substantive defects to the owning task. Record that cocoaskills has no separate lint command unless one is added before execution, and run any declared lint gate that exists at that time.","status":"backlog","title":"Verify integrated csk schema v6 implementation"}
